]

#answer([$2$])

#solution[
$log _(2)sqrt(2)= log _(2)2^((1)/(2))=(1)/(2)$，$log _(9)27= log _(3^(2))3^(3)=(3)/(2)$，所以原式的值为 $(1)/(2)+(3)/(2)=2$.
